The following figure shows the distribution of RRA score in the comparison sym-03-03-TP6 vs Sym-pool-1-1,Sym-pool-1-2,Sym-pool-1-3 pos., and the RRA scores of 10 genes.

<<echo=FALSE>>=
gstable=read.table('pooled_screen_1_counts_filtered_mageck.gene_summary.txt',header=T)
